msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"(This balloon is pretty much deflated, but maybe the kid\r\n"
"will want it anyway.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Um... Excuse me, sir... But is that your balloon?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "No... Some kid who got lost asked me to get this for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"He told me he couldn't see his mom again if he didn't have it. And after "
"seeing him cry the way he did, there's no way I could turn him down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "By any chance... Would this child be around ten years old?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'd say he's about that age... Wait a minute, you\r\n"
"wouldn't happen to be his mother, would you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Yes, I am! Could you please take me to him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Sure. Follow me."
msgstr ""

